%% EasyKiConverter Website development workflow
%% Mermaid source; labels are bilingual for shared use in Chinese and English docs.
flowchart TD
    A[需求 Issue / Requirement] --> B[创建 feature 或 fix 分支 / Create branch]
    B --> C[开发与提交 / Implement and commit]
    C --> D[本地预览与测试 / Preview and test locally]
    D --> E{验证通过？ / Passed?}
    E -- 否 No --> C
    E -- 是 Yes --> F[PR 到 version/V0.0.1 / PR to version branch]
    F --> G[代码审查与回归 / Review and regression]
    G --> H{版本稳定？ / Stable?}
    H -- 否 No --> I[创建修复分支 / Create fix branch]
    I --> C
    H -- 是 Yes --> J[PR 到 master / PR to master]
